	(text "V_PRE follows the set-point: PRE_FB = 0.2 x (V_PRE - SET_DRV) + 0.41 V and U9 holds it at 0.5 V,\nso V_PRE = SET_DRV + 0.45 V to 0.49 V (1.26 V at 0.8 V, 5.49 V at 5.0 V).\nSET_DRV = 2.1 x DAC: 0 V to 5.25 V in 1.28 mV steps. Firmware keeps it between 0.75 V and 5.0 V.\nU12: IN from V_PRE, VCONTROL from +13V5, minimum load R26 to -4V_A.\nU9 runs in forced PWM (PS/SYNC high), 2.4 MHz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 147.32 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
